From: Yeye B.B.C. <19569343+yeyebbc@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] scsi: ufs: qcom: Test link-off system sleep on SM8750

The TB522FU restores its hibernation image after a firmware reboot,
then UFS returns I/O errors. Its current system sleep level expects a
retained Hibern8 link. Test the existing link-off system sleep path on
SM8750 so resume reinitializes the host, device and queues. Keep its
runtime level unchanged and leave other Qualcomm hosts on their current
policy. The test does not establish that the SM8750 PHY loses power.

Signed-off-by: Yeye B.B.C. <19569343+yeyebbc@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/ufs/host/ufs-qcom.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-qcom.c b/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-qcom.c
index 954be9343f42ac14533fb6b585fa1662d0f4c352..c0d452dc4aebfc691948af456d575d89802acedd 100644
--- a/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-qcom.c
+++ b/drivers/ufs/host/ufs-qcom.c
@@ -3006,6 +3006,11 @@ static const struct ufs_qcom_drvdata ufs_qcom_sm8550_drvdata = {
 	.no_phy_retention = true,
 };
 
+/* Exercise a full link restart across hibernation on SM8750. */
+static const struct ufs_qcom_drvdata ufs_qcom_sm8750_drvdata = {
+	.no_phy_retention = true,
+};
+
 static const struct ufs_qcom_drvdata ufs_qcom_sa8255p_drvdata = {
 	.vops = &ufs_hba_qcom_sa8255p_vops
 };
@@ -3014,6 +3019,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id ufs_qcom_of_match[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,ufshc" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8550-ufshc", .data = &ufs_qcom_sm8550_drvdata },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8650-ufshc", .data = &ufs_qcom_sm8550_drvdata },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8750-ufshc", .data = &ufs_qcom_sm8750_drvdata },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sa8255p-ufshc", .data = &ufs_qcom_sa8255p_drvdata },
 	{},
 };
